# ---- AI assistant working files ----
# Kept local: this repo is public and doubles as a portfolio artifact, so the
# planning/strategy material stays off it. Remove these lines if you'd rather
# share them — CLAUDE.md is normally committed.
#
# `.claude/` is where all working state lives, including the project docs that
# used to sit at `docs/`: `.claude/docs/STATE.md` (current status) and
# `.claude/docs/DECISIONS.md` (why the rules are what they are). Notes, plans
# and anything else *about* the work belong there too — not at the repo root.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
research/
